\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Ukraine  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  cuts rates by 50 bps\b0\par\par\uc2 313 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 2013\par 09:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Writes through with rate cut officially announced)\par \par \uc2 KIEV, Aug 12 (Reuters) - \uc2 Ukraine's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut its main interest rate to 6.50 percent from 7.00 percent on Monday, seeking to bolster the former Soviet republic's stagnating economy.\par \par \uc2 The cut takes effect from Tuesday and means that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's overnight loan rate will be reduced to 7.50 percent from 8.00 percent, Olena Shcherbakova, the head of the bank's monetary policy department, told reporters.\par \par \uc2 "It is clear today that the economy needs financial resources and we hope that lending will pick up somewhat," she said.\par \par \uc2 The bank last cut the rate in June, also by 50 basis points . It had indicated then that it might ease policy further.\par \par \uc2 Ukraine's economy slipped into recession in the second half of 2012. Although it expanded 0.5 percent quarter-on-quarter in the first quarter of this year, it shrank again, by 0.4 percent, in the second quarter.\par \par \uc2 In year-on-year terms, the economy shrank both in the first and second quarters. The \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  expects Ukraine to post zero growth this year.\par \par \uc2 Some analysts, including IMF economists, believe Ukraine's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the hryvnia, is overvalued, which hampers exports and hurts the balance of payments.\par \par \uc2 However, Kiev has kept the hryvnia pegged at about 8 per dollar since 2010 and the June interest rate cut had no effect on the exchange rate.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  have helped whittle away \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, which now cover about three months of imports, a level analysts warn puts it at risk of a balance of payments crisis. (Reporting by Natalia Zinets; Writing by Olzhas Auyezov; Editing by Catherine Evans)\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-CBANK/RATE (UPDATE 2) | ABN | M | D | E | RBN | RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020130812e98c000jb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
